{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6159","title":"Xiaomi Unveils REDMI Pad 2 9.7 Series tablets merging portability with powerful performance","desc":"Xiaomi today introduced its latest tablet portfolio, REDMI Pad 2 9.7 Series, including REDMI Pad 2 9.7 and an accompanying 4G variant, REDMI Pad 2 9.7 4G, to its international markets.","view_cnt":"5159","like_cnt":"2","add_time":"1776934046","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/97_operatorx_operatorx_opx/23/04/2026/5b667353d1fbd64a4309e5ff5e98d3a8.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, April 28, 2026\u003c/strong\u003e – Xiaomi today introduced its latest tablet portfolio, REDMI Pad 2 9.7 Series, including REDMI Pad 2 9.7 and an accompanying 4G variant, REDMI Pad 2 9.7 4G, to its international markets. This all-new compact version of REDMI Pad 2 Series brings a more portable option to users around the world, together with all-round upgrades compared to the previous generation. These include a larger display, higher capacity battery, enhanced performance, and a slimmer design, making REDMI Pad 2 9.7 Series ideal for immersive entertainment on the go.\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/478_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/04/2026/0ebba6a627e568a3cf5ff7663d6232ba.jpg\" alt=\"A tablet is facing up, displaying a colorful screen with a white background.\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh resolution, vibrant visuals, and silky smoothness\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDetermining the level of entertainment that users can enjoy on their tablet is first and foremost the screen, and with this, REDMI Pad 2 9.7 Series delivers with perfection, offering the ideal blend of crystal-clear resolution, immersive visuals, and true-to-life colors on a large 9.7-inch display.¹ Images are sharp and clear, thanks to a high 2K resolution. Meanwhile, a wide color gamut ensures colors remain true-to-life to reproduce scenes in their original detail and vibrancy.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlso key to an ideal display is assurance, even with long periods of viewing. REDMI Pad 2 9.7 Series comes with triple TÜV Rheinland certifications for eye-care, and up to 600 nits brightness under bright sunlight in Outdoor mode, for reliable viewing whether indoors or out. Meanwhile, scrolling through content feels buttery smooth with the support of an up to 120Hz refresh rate.²\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/168_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/04/2026/3fd62390307a5e0d38e2d685e1af4f40.jpg\" alt=\"A presentation of a tablet computer, with dynamic colorful wave effects on the screen and a simple white background.\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-capacity battery and strong performance for lengthy sessions\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eParticularly for longer entertainment sessions, endurance is essential. REDMI Pad 2 9.7 Series is equipped with a massive 7600mAh (typ) battery, capable of offering up to 1.7 days of use.³\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlongside the large battery to power entertainment sessions is a powerful Snapdragon® 6s 4G Gen 2 Mobile Platform. Boasting an impressive 34% enhancement in performance and a high AnTuTu score of over 400,000,⁴ this 6nm octa-core processor can achieve a clock speed of up to 2.9GHz, together with improved heat dissipation compared to the previous generation, bringing assurance during long periods of use.⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/531_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/04/2026/393a737a582e27e444880271db07de6e.jpg\" alt=\"A blue glowing electronic component is located at the top of the device, with a white background showing the internal structure of the device.\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRefreshed interface design and seamless interconnectivity\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNot only does REDMI Pad 2 9.7 Series feature impressive hardware, but it is also equipped with Xiaomi's latest operating system, Xiaomi HyperOS 3, in-box.⁵ With this comes a more intuitive user interface, including a refreshed lockscreen and wallpapers to unlock more customization options. Xiaomi smartphone owners can also enjoy the benefits of Xiaomi Interconnectivity, including a shared clipboard for quicker and easier copying and pasting between their phone and tablet.⁶ Meanwhile, Circle to Search by Google is offered, making image search simpler.⁷\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSlim, durable design for ultimate portability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBoasting a sleek modern look at just 7.4mm slim,³ REDMI Pad 2 9.7 Series offers two color options, Graphite Gray or Silver.⁸ The 4G variant stands out with an end-to-end strip, which extends from the top to the bottom of the tablet, around its waterdrop-style camera module, and across its metallic exterior for a touch of class. Meanwhile, REDMI Pad 2 9.7 is equipped with a full metal unibody design for a more classic look.⁹ Both tablets are not only aesthetically pleasing but also highly durable, having successfully passed over 40 rigorous durability tests.³\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/772_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/23/04/2026/a0021a873df8edef805c9feb444eb94a.jpg\" alt=\"A hand is holding a tablet computer, showing its side profile. The background is pure white, highlighting the tablet's design.\"\u003eREDMI Pad 2 9.7 and REDMI Pad 2 9.7 4G are ideal for on-the-go entertainment, boasting a high resolution, vibrant display, and a slim and durable design, together with cutting-edge performance, bringing another option to REDMI Pad 2 Series' wide-ranging portfolio.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePricing and availability¹⁰\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Pad 2 9.7 comes in two storage options, 4GB + 64GB and 4GB + 128GB,¹¹ starting from 179 USD.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Pad 2 9.7 4G comes in two storage options, 4GB + 64GB and 4GB + 128GB,¹¹ starting from 199 USD.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eProduct images are available \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgCD-9XxRykBTpmZph8oz_MOAfdre2R_6-nTz62Ed_wJjMY?e=X1tZAM\"\u003e\u003cem\u003ehere\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;REDMI Pad 2 9.7 Series Quick Specs\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable style=\"min-width: 75px;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol style=\"min-width: 25px;\"\u003e\u003ccol style=\"min-width: 25px;\"\u003e\u003ccol style=\"min-width: 25px;\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eREDMI Pad 2 9.7\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eREDMI Pad 2 9.7 4G\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e9.7-inch crystal-clear display¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e2K (2048 x 1280) resolution\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAspect ratio: 16:10\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eRefresh rate: Up to 120Hz²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTouch sampling rate: Up to 180Hz\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBrightness: 500 nits (typ), 600 nits (Outdoor mode)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Software Solution) Certified, TÜV Rheinland Flicker Free Certified, TÜV Rheinland Circadian Friendly Certified\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e9.7-inch crystal-clear display¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e2K (2048 x 1280) resolution\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAspect ratio: 16:10\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eRefresh rate: Up to 120Hz²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTouch sampling rate: Up to 180Hz\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBrightness: 500 nits (typ), 600 nits (Outdoor mode)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eTÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Software Solution) Certified, TÜV Rheinland Flicker Free Certified, TÜV Rheinland Circadian Friendly Certified\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eMetal unibody⁹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eDimensions: 226.51mm x 147.97mm x 7.4mm³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eWeight: 406g³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eColors: Graphite Gray, Silver⁸\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eDimensions: 226.51mm x 147.97mm x 7.4mm³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eWeight: 401g³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eColors: Graphite Gray, Silver⁸\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerformance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSnapdragon® 6s 4G Gen 2 Mobile Platform\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e6nm manufacturing process\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eGPU: Adreno 610\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eCPU: Octa-core processor\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAvailable configurations:¹¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e4GB + 64GB\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e4GB + 128GB\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eLP4X memory and UFS 2.2 storage\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSnapdragon® 6s 4G Gen 2 Mobile Platform with 4G\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e6nm manufacturing process\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eGPU: Adreno 610\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eCPU: Octa-core processor\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAvailable configurations:¹¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e4GB + 64GB\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e4GB + 128GB\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eLP4X memory and UFS 2.2 storage\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery and Charging\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e7600mAh (typ) battery\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e18W fast charging¹²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eUSB Type-C\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e7600mAh (typ) battery\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e18W fast charging¹²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eUSB Type-C\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCameras\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e8MP rear camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ef/2.0\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e1.12μm pixel size\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e5MP front camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ef/2.2\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e1.12μm pixel size\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eRear camera video recording\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e1080P (1920x1080) at 30fps\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e720P (1280x720) at 30fps\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFront camera video recording\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e1080P (1920x1080) at 30fps\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e720P (1280x720) at 30fps\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e8MP rear camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ef/2.0\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e1.12μm pixel size\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e5MP front camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ef/2.2\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e1.12μm pixel size\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eRear camera video recording\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e1080P (1920x1080) at 30fps\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e720P (1280x720) at 30fps\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFront camera video recording\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e1080P (1920x1080) at 30fps\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e720P (1280x720) at 30fps\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eImmersive stereo speakers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eHi-Res certification\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e3.5mm headphone jack\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSupported audio formats: MP3, FLAC, AAC, OGG, WAV, AMR, AWB\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eImmersive stereo speakers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eHi-Res certification\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e3.5mm headphone jack\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSupported audio formats: MP3, FLAC, AAC, OGG, WAV, AMR, AWB\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eWi-Fi: 2.4GHz | 5GHz\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBluetooth® 5.0\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eWi-Fi: 2.4GHz | 5GHz\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eBluetooth® 5.0\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eXiaomi HyperOS 3⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eXiaomi HyperOS 3⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAccessories\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eREDMI Pad 2 Cover 9.7¹³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eREDMI Pad 2 Cover 9.7¹³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹ REDMI Pad 2 9.7 and REDMI Pad 2 9.7 4G screen size is about 9.7 inches when measured diagonally. Viewable area is smaller due to the curved corners. Measurements between individual products may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e² Refresh rate can be adjusted up to 120Hz for supported apps and games. Please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³ Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁴ Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs, compared to the previous generation (REDMI Pad SE 8.7 and REDMI Pad SE 8.7 4G). Actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁵ Availability of Xiaomi HyperOS features, apps and services may vary depending on software version and product model.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁶ Phones and tablets need to be upgraded to Xiaomi HyperOS 3 with Bluetooth® and WLAN settings activated. They must be logged in to the same Xiaomi account, and \"Settings-Xiaomi Interconnectivity\" has to be turned on. Availability of specific features, and services may vary depending on software version, apps and product model. Please refer to actual use.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁷ Available on select devices, and an internet connection is required. Works on compatible apps and surfaces. Results may vary depending on visual matches.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁸ Color availability may vary between markets.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁹ The metal unibody design refers specifically to the back cover of the product and does not include the camera deco, buttons, card slots, or other components.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁰ Prices and promotions for different markets may vary due to VAT, taxes, and other factors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹¹ Available configurations may differ between different regions. Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹² No power adapter is included in-box in certain regions. In regions with a power adapter in-box, a 15W compatible charger is included.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹³ Accessories sold separately, availability may vary between regions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENDS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In December 2025, the MAU reached 754.1 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform. As of December 31, 2025, the number of IoT devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) reached 1,079.2 million. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merging personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2025, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the seventh year in a row, ranking 297th.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"3655","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1777338008"},"common":null}